lose the race ♪

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:42.495
♪ Smoke on the water,
a fire in the sky ♪

00:02:43.495 --> 00:02:48.868
♪ Smoke on the water ♪

00:04:02.709 --> 00:04:07.113
♪ We ended up at
the Grand Hotel ♪

00:04:07.246 --> 00:04:10.016
♪ It was empty, cold and bare ♪

00:04:10.149 --> 00:04:15.521
