a few old beds ♪

00:04:23.562 --> 00:04:26.599
♪ We made a place to sweat ♪

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:31.804
♪ No matter what we
get out of this ♪

00:04:31.938 --> 00:04:35.575
♪ I know, I know we'll
never forget ♪

00:04:35.708 --> 00:04:42.982
♪ Smoke on the water,
a fire in the sky ♪

00:04:44.116 --> 00:04:49.322
♪ Smoke on the water ♪

00:05:06.305 --> 00:05:12.645
♪ Woo, yeahhhhhh ♪

00:05:21.853 --> 00:05:28.861
♪ Burn, burn, burn, burn,
burn up in the sky ♪

00:05:54.353 --> 00:06:01.728
♪ Ahhhhhhhhhhh ♪

00:06:06.231 --> 00:06:12.071
♪♪♪

00:06:12.204 --> 00:06:14.440
Ah, break a leg Frank.

